data: {"id": "41cfa9ab580246dc-thinking-parallel_evidence-912", "run_id": "41cfa9ab580246dc", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "# 证据结论\n\n## 已采集事实\n\n### 1. Kubernetes 生命周期 (Metrics + Describe)\n- **Pod 状态**: `Pending`，`ContainersNotReady`，`containerStatus.app.reason=ContainerCreating`\n- **等待原因** (PromQL): `kube_pod_container_status_waiting_reason=1`，`reason=\"ContainerCreating\"`，确认 Pod 持续处于等待阶段。\n- **重启次数**: 0，说明从未成功启动过容器。\n- **节点**: `node2/10.2.0.50`\n\n### 2. Events (Describe)\n- **核心事件**: `Warning FailedMount` (x40 over 69m): `MountVolume.SetUp failed for volume \"input\" : secret \"unavailable-input\" not found`\n- **次要事件**: `Warni", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 6, "ts_ms": 1789121597557, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

