data: {"id": "41cfa9ab580246dc-node_start-conclusion", "run_id": "41cfa9ab580246dc", "seq": 914, "ts_ms": 1789121605840, "node": "conclusion", "node_name": "汇总总结"}

event: node_complete
data: {"id": "41cfa9ab580246dc-node_complete-conclusion", "run_id": "41cfa9ab580246dc", "seq": 915, "ts_ms": 1789121612253, "node": "conclusion", "node_name": "汇总总结", "duration_seconds": 6.414, "state_snapshot": {"conclusion_length": 1293, "has_errors": false, "has_warnings": false, "conclusion": "## 📊 异常概览与现象\n\n| 组 | 异常实体 | 异常状态 | 关键错误信息 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| g1 | `aiops-case-v04/workload` | ContainerCreating | Pod workload in aiops-case-v04 is stuck in ContainerCreating/Pending state |\n\n---\n\n## 🕵️ 证据内容 · g1\n\n| # | 类型 | 来源 | 真实原始结果 | 诊断作用 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | K8s Event | kubernetes | `Warning FailedMount ... MountVolume.SetUp failed for volume \"input\" : secret \"unavailable-input\" not found` | 提供挂载失败的直接原因，确认为 Secret 缺失导致 |\n| 2 | K8s State | kubernetes | `reason: ContainerCreating` (container: app) | 确认容器未能进入运行或重启状态，处于初始化等待 |\n| 3 | Metric | prometheus | `kube_pod_container_status_waiting_reason` 为 1 (`ContainerCreating`) | 从监控面确认容器处于 Waiting 状态的事实 |\n| 4 | Metric | prometheus | `kube_pod_status_phase` 为 1 (`Pending`) | 从监控面确认 Pod 处于 Pending 状态，佐证集群状态异常 |\n\n证据 1 明确指出了故障的具体机制是挂载名为 `input` 的卷时找不到 `unavailable-input` Secret。证据 2、3 和 4 相互印证，表明 Pod 一直卡在初始化阶段（Waiting/Pending）且没有触发重启（Restart Count 为 0），这符合由于配置缺失导致的启动阻塞特征。\n\n## 🎯 根因分析 · g1\n\n### 因果链\n\n```text\n缺失 Secret 'unavailable-input' → Kubelet 挂载卷 'input' 失败 → 触发 MountVolume.SetUp 错误 → Pod 持续处于 ContainerCreating/Pending 状态\n```\n\n### 根因结论\n\n已确认的根因：Pod `aiops-case-v04/workload` 的 Volume 配置引用了不存在于当前命名空间的 Secret `unavailable-input`。Kubelet 在启动容器前尝试挂载该卷，因无法找到对应的 Secret 而直接报错（见证据 1），导致容器初始化阻塞在 `ContainerCreating` 状态（见证据 2-4）。", "conclusion_formatted": "## 📊 异常概览与现象\n\n| 组 | 异常实体 | 异常状态 | 关键错误信息 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| g1 | `aiops-case-v04/workload` | ContainerCreating | Pod workload in aiops-case-v04 is stuck in ContainerCreating/Pending state |\n\n---\n\n## 🕵️ 证据内容 · g1\n\n| # | 类型 | 来源 | 真实原始结果 | 诊断作用 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | K8s Event | kubernetes | `Warning FailedMount ... MountVolume.SetUp failed for volume \"input\" : secret \"unavailable-input\" not found` | 提供挂载失败的直接原因，确认为 Secret 缺失导致 |\n| 2 | K8s State | kubernetes | `reason: ContainerCreating` (container: app) | 确认容器未能进入运行或重启状态，处于初始化等待 |\n| 3 | Metric | prometheus | `kube_pod_container_status_waiting_reason` 为 1 (`ContainerCreating`) | 从监控面确认容器处于 Waiting 状态的事实 |\n| 4 | Metric | prometheus | `kube_pod_status_phase` 为 1 (`Pending`) | 从监控面确认 Pod 处于 Pending 状态，佐证集群状态异常 |\n\n证据 1 明确指出了故障的具体机制是挂载名为 `input` 的卷时找不到 `unavailable-input` Secret。证据 2、3 和 4 相互印证，表明 Pod 一直卡在初始化阶段（Waiting/Pending）且没有触发重启（Restart Count 为 0），这符合由于配置缺失导致的启动阻塞特征。\n\n## 🎯 根因分析 · g1\n\n### 因果链\n\n```text\n缺失 Secret 'unavailable-input' → Kubelet 挂载卷 'input' 失败 → 触发 MountVolume.SetUp 错误 → Pod 持续处于 ContainerCreating/Pending 状态\n```\n\n### 根因结论\n\n已确认的根因：Pod `aiops-case-v04/workload` 的 Volume 配置引用了不存在于当前命名空间的 Secret `unavailable-input`。Kubelet 在启动容器前尝试挂载该卷，因无法找到对应的 Secret 而直接报错（见证据 1），导致容器初始化阻塞在 `ContainerCreating` 状态（见证据 2-4）。"}, "handoff_summary": ""}

event: final
data: {"id": "41cfa9ab580246dc-final", "run_id": "41cfa9ab580246dc", "seq": 917, "ts_ms": 1789121612262, "status": "success", "answer": "## 📊 异常概览与现象\n\n| 组 | 异常实体 | 异常状态 | 关键错误信息 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| g1 | `aiops-case-v04/workload` | ContainerCreating | Pod workload in aiops-case-v04 is stuck in ContainerCreating/Pending state |\n\n---\n\n## 🕵️ 证据内容 · g1\n\n| # | 类型 | 来源 | 真实原始结果 | 诊断作用 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | K8s Event | kubernetes | `Warning FailedMount ... MountVolume.SetUp failed for volume \"input\" : secret \"unavailable-input\" not found` | 提供挂载失败的直接原因，确认为 Secret 缺失导致 |\n| 2 | K8s State | kubernetes | `reason: ContainerCreating` (container: app) | 确认容器未能进入运行或重启状态，处于初始化等待 |\n| 3 | Metric | prometheus | `kube_pod_container_status_waiting_reason` 为 1 (`ContainerCreating`) | 从监控面确认容器处于 Waiting 状态的事实 |\n| 4 | Metric | prometheus | `kube_pod_status_phase` 为 1 (`Pending`) | 从监控面确认 Pod 处于 Pending 状态，佐证集群状态异常 |\n\n证据 1 明确指出了故障的具体机制是挂载名为 `input` 的卷时找不到 `unavailable-input` Secret。证据 2、3 和 4 相互印证，表明 Pod 一直卡在初始化阶段（Waiting/Pending）且没有触发重启（Restart Count 为 0），这符合由于配置缺失导致的启动阻塞特征。\n\n## 🎯 根因分析 · g1\n\n### 因果链\n\n```text\n缺失 Secret 'unavailable-input' → Kubelet 挂载卷 'input' 失败 → 触发 MountVolume.SetUp 错误 → Pod 持续处于 ContainerCreating/Pending 状态\n```\n\n### 根因结论\n\n已确认的根因：Pod `aiops-case-v04/workload` 的 Volume 配置引用了不存在于当前命名空间的 Secret `unavailable-input`。Kubelet 在启动容器前尝试挂载该卷，因无法找到对应的 Secret 而直接报错（见证据 1），导致容器初始化阻塞在 `ContainerCreating` 状态（见证据 2-4）。\n\n---\n\n## 📊 性能统计\n\n```text\n├─ 总耗时: 1.1m\n├─ 问题定位: 20.5s\n├─ 并发证据采集: 37.3s\n│  └─ g1 aiops-case-v04/workload: 37.3s (Evidence 29.0s, RCA 8.1s)\n└─ 汇总总结: 6.4s\n```\n\n📋 Runbook 参考\n\n- **g1 aiops-case-v04/workload**: pod-volume-mount-failed\n", "answer_source": "workflow", "elapsed_seconds": 64.241, "metrics": {"run_id": "41cfa9ab580246dc", "mttr": {"value": "1.1m", "seconds": 64.25124144554138, "pass": true, "threshold": "< 10.0m"}, "evidence_completeness": {"value": "0%", "collected": 0, "planned": 0, "pass": false, "threshold": "> 90%"}, "root_cause_confidence": {"value": "48%", "pass": false, "threshold": ">= 80%"}, "runbook_coverage": {"matched": true, "runbook_id": "pod-volume-mount-failed", "pass": true, "score": 1.0, "breakdown": [{"description": "Runbook 引用", "weight": 0.5, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.5}, {"description": "核心 Runbook 识别", "weight": 0.3, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.3}, {"description": "Runbook 结论关联", "weight": 0.2, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.2}]}, "confidence_breakdown": [{"name": "evidence_strength", "weight": 0.35, "score": 0.0, "weighted_score": 0.0, "description": "加权证据完整率", "detail": "加权完整率 0%"}, {"name": "causal_chain", "weight": 0.2, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.2, "description": "因果链完整性", "detail": "完整因果链"}, {"name": "tool_coverage", "weight": 0.1, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.03, "description": "关键探针覆盖率", "detail": "工具成功率 30%"}, {"name": "runbook_match", "weight": 0.15, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.15, "description": "Runbook 匹配质量", "detail": "核心: pod-volume-mount-failed"}, {"name": "llm_self_score", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.5, "weighted_score": 0.1, "description": "LLM 自评分数", "detail": "来源: layer_confidence, 分数: 50%"}], "confidence_penalties": [], "evidence_breakdown": {"total": 0, "breakdown": {}}, "performance": {"total_duration_ms": 64251.24144554138, "llm_calls": 18, "llm_duration_ms": 60899.97100830078, "tool_calls": 16, "executed_tool_calls": 11, "deduplicated_tool_calls": 4, "successful_tool_calls": 15, "failed_tool_calls": 1, "tool_duration_ms": 5973.573684692383, "tool_wall_duration_ms": 2933.9964389801025}, "nodes": {"layer": {"name": "问题定位", "duration_ms": 20530.696392059326, "success": true}, "parallel_evidence": {"name": "并发证据采集", "duration_ms": 37283.936977386475, "success": true}, "evidence": {"name": "evidence", "duration_ms": 0.0, "success": true}, "rca": {"name": "rca", "duration_ms": 0.0, "success": true}, "conclusion": {"name": "汇总总结", "duration_ms": 6413.594961166382, "success": true}}, "success": tr